  "content": "<article class=\"gv-story gv-photo-only\"><header class=\"gv-intro\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Farmingdale, New Jersey · Wedding photography</p><h1>MaryKate &amp; Mark<br><em>Eagle Oaks Golf &amp; Country Club</em></h1><p class=\"gv-lede\">MaryKate and Mark’s wedding at Eagle Oaks Golf &amp; Country Club, photographed by GioLina.</p></header><section id=\"wedding-photographs\" class=\"gv-editorial\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-story-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Selected photographs</p><h2 id=\"gv-story-title\">A first look and time together.</h2><p>Wedding details, the first look and portraits of MaryKate and Mark outdoors.</p></section><section class=\"gv-gallery\" aria-label=\"Selected photographs of MaryKate &amp; Mark\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-ad2a40088bff65f5.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Mark’s boutonniere and bow tie on his wedding suit\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-ad2a40088bff65f5-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-ad2a40088bff65f5-small.webp 427w, /assets/v26-ad2a40088bff65f5.webp 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"800\" height=\"1199\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:800/1199\" alt=\"Mark’s boutonniere and bow tie on his wedding suit\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-73a89559b6b06046.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Mark waiting outside the clubhouse\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-73a89559b6b06046-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-73a89559b6b06046-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-73a89559b6b06046.webp 1279w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1279\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1279/853\" alt=\"Mark waiting outside the clubhouse\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-8f462ac503c37eb9.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View MaryKate approaching Mark for their first look\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-8f