approaching with Mark in the foreground\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-84a5dea622ceb686.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View MaryKate and Mark smiling together in a black and white portrait\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-84a5dea622ceb686-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-84a5dea622ceb686-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-84a5dea622ceb686.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/854\" alt=\"MaryKate and Mark smiling together in a black and white portrait\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-7e3a7caa814966bd.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View MaryKate and Mark holding hands beside the green\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-7e3a7caa814966bd-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-7e3a7caa814966bd-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-7e3a7caa814966bd.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/853\" alt=\"MaryKate and Mark holding hands beside the green\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-c826a461b11b5a7f.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View MaryKate and Mark together in a full-length wedding portrait\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-c826a461b11b5a7f-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-c826a461b11b5a7f-small.webp 427w, /assets/v26-c826a461b11b5a7f.webp 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"800\" height=\"1199\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:800/1199\" alt=\"MaryKate and Mark together in a full-length wedding portrait\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-035835ea8b478380.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View MaryKate smiling as Mark leans toward her\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-035835ea8b478380-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-035